<para>For each dimension <computeroutput>VectorDim</computeroutput> in <computeroutput>VectorDims</computeroutput>..., calls <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">evaluator(coord,<sp/>ddcHelper::get&lt;VectorDim&gt;(coeffs));</highlight></codeline>
