        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute first-order partial derivatives of a scalar function as a <ref refid="classVectorField" kindref="compound">VectorField</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For each dimension <computeroutput>VectorDim</computeroutput> in <computeroutput>VectorDims</computeroutput>..., evaluates the first derivative of the scalar function defined by <computeroutput>coeffs</computeroutput> in the direction <computeroutput>VectorDim::Dual</computeroutput>, storing the result in the corresponding component of <computeroutput>output:</computeroutput> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">evaluator.deriv(Idx&lt;ddc::Deriv&lt;typename<sp/>VectorDim::Dual&gt;&gt;(1),</highlight></codeline>
