</programlisting></para>
<para>This is the <ref refid="classVectorField" kindref="compound">VectorField</ref> counterpart of <computeroutput>evaluator.deriv(deriv_order, eval, coeffs)</computeroutput>, computing partial derivatives in all directions simultaneously.</para>
